# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Fulqrum](https://github.com/Qiskit/fulqrum) is a software package that computes eigenvalues and eigenvectors of Hamiltonians projected into a subspace. It constructs a portable representation of the projected Hamiltonian that you can pass to an eigenvalue solver of your choice, including standard off-the-shelf solvers. These solvers can provide a much faster alternative to the default PySCF solver that the SQD addon uses for diagonalization. For information on how to install and use Fulqrum, see the [Fulqrum documentation](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fulqrum).\n"
msgstr "Ang [Fulqrum](https://github.com/Qiskit/fulqrum) ay isang software package na kumukuwenta ng mga eigenvalue at eigenvector ng mga Hamiltonian na na-project sa isang subspace. Bumubuo ito ng portable na representasyon ng na-project na Hamiltonian na maaari mong ipasa sa eigenvalue solver na gusto mo, kasama ang mga standard na off-the-shelf na solver. Maaaring magbigay ang mga solver na ito ng mas mabilis na alternatibo sa default na PySCF solver na ginagamit ng SQD addon para sa diagonalization. Para sa impormasyon kung paano i-install at gamitin ang Fulqrum, tingnan ang [dokumentasyon ng Fulqrum](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fulqrum).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fulqrum's `addon_sqd_support` module builds a solver that [`diagonalize_fermionic_hamiltonian`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-sqd/fermion) accepts directly, so you pass the same integrals to both and Fulqrum handles the projection and diagonalization.\n"
msgstr "Ang module na `addon_sqd_support` ng Fulqrum ay bumubuo ng solver na direktang tinatanggap ng [`diagonalize_fermionic_hamiltonian`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-sqd/fermion), kaya ipinapasa mo ang parehong mga integral sa dalawa at ang Fulqrum na ang bahala sa projection at diagonalization.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more details on the SQD code used in this example, see the [chemistry Hamilton tutorial](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization).\n"
msgstr "Para sa karagdagang detalye tungkol sa SQD code na ginamit sa halimbawang ito, tingnan ang [tutorial ng chemistry Hamilton](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use a different eigensolver {#use-a-different-eigensolver}"
msgstr "Gumamit ng ibang eigensolver {#use-a-different-eigensolver}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because Fulqrum exposes the projected Hamiltonian as a standard [`scipy.sparse.linalg.LinearOperator`](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/generated/scipy.sparse.linalg.LinearOperator.html), you can diagonalize it with any eigensolver of your choosing rather than being tied to `scipy.sparse.linalg.eigsh`. This makes it straightforward to substitute a solver that is better suited to your problem size or hardware.\n"
msgstr "Dahil inilalantad ng Fulqrum ang na-project na Hamiltonian bilang standard na [`scipy.sparse.linalg.LinearOperator`](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/generated/scipy.sparse.linalg.LinearOperator.html), maaari mo itong i-diagonalize gamit ang anumang eigensolver na pipiliin mo sa halip na nakatali sa `scipy.sparse.linalg.eigsh`. Dahil dito, madaling magpalit ng solver na mas angkop sa laki ng problema o hardware mo.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pass the eigensolver you want as the `eigensolver` argument. As an example, this guide demonstrates [PRIMME](https://github.com/primme/primme), a high-performance eigensolver library. Its Python interface, `primme.eigsh`, follows a calling convention similar to `scipy.sparse.linalg.eigsh`, so you can use it as a direct replacement.\n"
msgstr "Ipasa ang eigensolver na gusto mo bilang argumentong `eigensolver`. Bilang halimbawa, ipinapakita ng gabay na ito ang [PRIMME](https://github.com/primme/primme), isang high-performance na eigensolver library. Ang Python interface nito, `primme.eigsh`, ay sumusunod sa calling convention na katulad ng `scipy.sparse.linalg.eigsh`, kaya maaari mo itong gamitin bilang direktang kapalit.\n"
